 are exceeded.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21ea9-f885-70e2-a7f2-6dddb30ba464","description":"429","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21ea9-f885-7819-9f22-ec2e1fd2a8a7","description":"408","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21ea9-f885-7ed0-8bb3-5aa9fa0b2945","description":"409","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21ea9-f885-7a80-a59a-278bcc580a0b","description":"451","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21ea9-f885-78cd-9837-bfc554ef4220","category":"01a21e5d-ee8b-768b-8713-3f779a056aaa","question":"Which HTTP status code says that the server understood a request but refuses to authorize it?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"A 403 Forbidden response means access is refused.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21ea9-f885-7e6b-beca-55c853334f9e","description":"403","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21ea9-f885-71a5-acf4-1c9bcbda7945","description":"401","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21ea9-f885-7101-8866-421ec1c7d329","description":"404","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21ea9-f885-7957-8385-36c5f32d29ab","description":"405","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21ea9-f885-7919-937a-338ef1336d0b","category":"01a21e5d-ee8b-768b-8713-3f779a056aaa","question":"Which HTTP response header does a server use to ask a browser to store a cookie?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"The Set-Cookie header provides cookie data and attributes to the browser.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21ea9-f885-735b-b918-a9c8a31c9347","description":"Set-Cookie","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21ea9-f885-71b7-9737-7fd242d4a677","description":"Cookie","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21ea9-f885-76a2-a9fb-f5721c71e90f","description":"Cache-Control","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21ea9-f885-771e-a9eb-ec9c58d98e81","description":"Authorization","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21ea9-f885-72c5-af62-c01b13196bda","category":"01a21e5d-ee8b-768b-8713-3f779a056aaa","question":"Which browser security rule restricts scripts from reading data on a site with another scheme, host, or port?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"The same-origin policy compares scheme, host, and port to limit cross-origin access.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21ea9-f885-78ac-92cc-feab608eb653","description":"Same-origin policy","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21ea9-f885-7d27-9fb8-047e58900c9e","description":"Content negotiation","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21ea9-f885-7148-9945-cb66f6aaff0d","description":"Principle of locality","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21ea9-f885-7da5-a46b-63b9089d8fff","description":"Robots exclusion protocol","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21ea9-f885-74b2-a29d-ae860abf4cc3","category":"01a21e5d-ee8b-768b-8713-3f779a056aaa","question":"Which HTTP-based mechanism lets servers permit selected cross-origin browser requests?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Cross-Origin Resource Sharing uses headers to declare which origins may access resources.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21ea9-f885-76da-8b49-f0042720263f","description":"CORS","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21ea9-f885-7002-8a52-34532d32e195","description":"CSRF","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21ea9-f885-7dff-81de-7bb16defe377","description":"CDN","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21ea9-f885-798d-9001-344fe733cf87","description":"CGI","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21ea9-f885-7b5d-adeb-d5fe2bb4b9df","category":"01a21e5d-ee8b-768b-8713-3f779a056aaa","question":"Which web attack injects malicious script into content viewed by other users?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Cross-site scripting runs attacker-controlled script in a victim\'s browser.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21ea9-f885-716f-9d4f-894707522d64","description":"Cross-site scripting","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21ea9-f885-74c9-b86b-8d35881fd9a5","description":"Cross-site request forgery","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21ea9-f885-717a-a776-502f6142be29","description":"SQL injection","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21ea9-f885-7ea4-aaf3-52181ef0f5cf","description":"Clickjacking","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21ea9-f885-7e6b-88f8-8c0282526799","category":"01a21e